---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Getting Started" description="Start on Boing Network: get a wallet, get testnet BOING, build, or run a node.">
  <article class="page-wrap-full">
    <header class="page-hero-full">
      <div class="page-wrap-inner gs-inner">
        <span class="stage-badge-global">Testnet</span>
        <h1>Getting Started</h1>
        <p class="lead">Pick your path. Everything here runs on Boing Testnet and costs nothing.</p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="page-wrap-inner gs-inner gs-tracks">
      <section class="track" aria-labelledby="track-user">
        <h2 id="track-user">I want to use Boing</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="https://boing.express" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Create a wallet in Boing Express</a> (web, or the Chrome extension to connect dApps).</li>
          <li><a href="/faucet">Get testnet BOING</a> from the faucet.</li>
          <li>Send your first transfer in Boing Express, then find it on <a href="https://boing.observer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Boing Observer</a>.</li>
          <li>Swap or provide liquidity on <a href="https://boing.finance" target="_blank" rel="noopener">boing.finance</a> (select Boing Testnet).</li>
        </ol>
      </section>
      <section class="track" aria-labelledby="track-builder">
        <h2 id="track-builder">I want to build</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Follow the <a href="/developers/quickstart">Developer Quickstart</a>: install the CLI, fund a key, deploy a token with <code>boing token</code>.</li>
          <li>Integrate wallets and RPC: <a href="/docs#rpc-api">RPC API</a> and the in-repo <code>boing-sdk</code>.</li>
          <li>No-code token or pool: <a href="https://boing.finance" target="_blank" rel="noopener">boing.finance</a> deploy wizard.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>
      <section class="track" aria-labelledby="track-operator">
        <h2 id="track-operator">I want to run a node</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Build and run <code>boing-node</code>: <a href="/docs#getting-started">Documentation → Getting Started (node)</a>.</li>
          <li><a href="/testnet/join">Join the public testnet</a> and register as an operator.</li>
          <li>Check bootnodes and status: <a href="/bootnodes">Bootnodes</a>, <a href="/status">Status</a>.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
<style>
  .gs-inner { max-width: 960px; }
  .lead { color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .gs-tracks { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; padding-bottom: 3rem; }
  .track { padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 1rem; background: rgba(18, 24, 41, 0.6); }
  .track h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; color: var(--text-primary); }
  .track ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-secondary); }
  .track li { margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .track a { color: var(--accent-teal); }
  .track code { background: var(--bg-tertiary); padding: 0.1em 0.35em; border-radius: 4px; }
</style>